# Backend Java

Follow `FlowDesk-Backend/docs/standards/backend.md`.

- Feature packages: `.<feature>/{api,service,repository,dto,entity,mapper,exception}` — not layer-first trees.
- Controllers return DTOs only (MapStruct). Never entities. Always `ApiResponse<T>`.
- `@Valid` on DTOs; business rules in services.
- One `@RestControllerAdvice`; `BaseException` → `ErrorCode`.
- `@ConfigurationProperties`; secrets from env; no scattered `@Value`.
- SLF4J + MDC correlation ID. JWT stateless. `@PreAuthorize` for roles. One CORS config.
- Tests: `@WebMvcTest` / `@DataJpaTest`+Testcontainers / mocked service tests.
- Side-effect POST: `Idempotency-Key`. Paths `/api/v1/`.
- Shared envelope/errors in `common-lib` before feature controllers.
